// Which process a send reaches, over the targets the points-to stage
// resolved (processes.dl, staged by points_to.dl).
//
// Prerequisites: include clientlib/imports.dl and clientlib/otp.dl
// (which brings staged_processes.dl) before this file.

// The send at `id` in `func`, carrying `message`, may reach `proc`: the
// send's own target, or, when `func` sends to its parameter, whatever its
// callers hand it (process_call).
.decl send_target(id: symbol, func: symbol, message: symbol, proc: symbol)

send_target(id, f, m, p) :- pid_send(id, f, m, _, _), call_site_target(id, f, "info", p).
